OL,3,GNEWSAMass clean-up after heavy rain and
OL,4,Aflooding                               
OL,6,FResident Daniel Kemp said he woke up to
OL,7,Fgo to work and found "the whole of the 
OL,8,Froad flooded" and "people could not    
OL,9,Fpass".                                 
